+     content it carries. -->
+
+Export `createPatch(from, to)` from `src/index.ts`: returns a JSON Patch (RFC 6902) that turns `from` into
+`to` when applied with `applyPatch`; neither input is modified. The patch is minimal in scope: objects are
+diffed member by member and nested values recursively, so a small change yields a small patch. Arrays are
+diffed by longest common subsequence: an inserted or deleted item is one add or remove, and a moved item is
+a remove plus an add, never a rewrite of the items around it. Tests in `src/index.test.ts` check that the
+patch round-trips through `applyPatch` and that it is small.
